    "dom": {
      "mainText": "Home\n/\nMarkets\n/\nEuropean Union\n/ Poland\nTitanium Dioxide Supplier for Poland\n\nMalaysia-origin titanium dioxide raw material for industrial procurement in Poland. Review grades for coatings, plastics and masterbatch production, or send us your application, estimated quantity and delivery requirements for a quotation.\n\nRequest a Quote\n \nExplore Products\nConfirm the Material You Need\n\nThe products presented by TiO2 Malaysia are industrial titanium dioxide raw materials. A finished white masterbatch combines TiO2 with a polymer carrier. If you produce masterbatch, evaluate the TiO2 grade as an input to your own formulation and process.\n\nPrepare Your Product Review\n\nYou do not need to know the exact grade before you start. Begin with the application information your team already knows, then compare the relevant grades on the product pages.\n\nCoatings\n\nUse your coating system and end use—such as decorative, construction or industrial applications—to decide which grade properties are relevant to compare on the product pages.\n\nPlastics and masterbatch\n\nCompare grade information against the resin, processing route and finished product, such as film, bags, pipes or fittings. Evaluate direct use in a plastic product separately from TiO2 used as an input for masterbatch production.\n\nExplore Products\nDocuments for Product and Supplier Review\n\nFor a grade you are evaluating, request the TDS, SDS, COA or origin documentation your team needs for review. Select the Product Grade and document types on the request form.\n\nA Certificate of Origin is available upon request.\n\nIf you are still deciding on a grade, explore the product pages or continue to the quotation request with “Not sure / Need help.”\n\nRequest Documents\n \nView Document Hub\nRequest a Quote for Delivery to Poland\n\nTell us about your current requirement, including the application, required or estimated quantity, and delivery location in Poland. Select the product or grade you are evaluating, or choose “Not sure / Need help” if you have not decided yet.\n\nIf you are considering more than one grade, add that context in Additional Requirements.\n\nOur team will review your requirements and contact you using the details provided.\n\nRequest a Quote\n \nEuropean Union Procurement Overview",
